# URL template for a legal MapLibre-compatible vector tile source.
# Expected schema: OpenMapTiles-like layer names (water, park, building, transportation, place).
# Example format: https://your-tile-provider.example/tiles/{z}/{x}/{y}.pbf?key=YOUR_KEY
# No usar tiles de Google Maps, Apple Maps ni servidores públicos de OSM en producción.
